{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22088","headline":"新乐府 黑潭龙\t疾贪吏也 · 白居易","name":"新乐府 黑潭龙\t疾贪吏也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黑潭水深黑如墨，传有神龙人不识。\n潭上架屋官立祠，龙不能神人神之。\n丰凶水旱与疾疫，乡里皆言龙所爲。\n家家养豚漉清酒，朝祈暮赛依巫口。\n神之来兮风飘飘，纸钱动兮锦伞摇。\n神之去兮风亦静，香火灭兮杯盘冷。\n肉堆潭岸石，酒泼庙前草。\n不知龙神享几多，林鼠山狐长醉饱。\n狐何幸，豚何辜，年年杀豚将餧狐。\n狐假龙神食豚尽，九重泉底龙知无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}